  (text "Reserve a separate left-side antenna zone. Keep unrelated copper, ground planes and signal routes out on all layers.\nPlace the USB connector and switching LED current paths outside this zone. NFC works without USB power.\nTune the assembled tag per ST AN2866, with a coupling loop / VNA and real phones; target resonance 13.6-14.0 MHz.\nC30 is not fitted initially; select C0G value only after measurement. Do not treat the illustrative loop value as validated.\nWrite a short HTTPS NDEF URI after the real portfolio URL is confirmed. QR will point to the same URL."
    (at 25.4 195.58 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "24b70734-2e49-5a2b-82da-fa28785c3ac5"))
